rule: TEST_DISABLED
issue: 432
title: an item-class runtest replacement that calls the captured original still runs the test
origin: ruling 432.Q4: a class-level replacement delegates when a call in it mentions a
origin2: carrier of the original. The same source is the capture-and-call control of
origin3: test_delegating_item_class_runtest_stays_silent.
=== head: app.py ===
def value():
    return 0
=== head: tests/test_value.py ===
from app import value


def test_value():
    assert value() == 1
=== after: tests/conftest.py ===
import pytest

_original = pytest.Function.runtest
pytest.Function.runtest = lambda self: _original(self)
